          },
          {
            "index": 3505,
            "source_segment_index": 3505,
            "start_ms": 6747130,
            "end_ms": 6749150,
            "text": "12号平民7号八号11号"
          },
          {
            "index": 3506,
            "source_segment_index": 3506,
            "start_ms": 6749150,
            "end_ms": 6751890,
            "text": "本游戏的混血儿6号榜样是4号狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 3507,
            "source_segment_index": 3507,
            "start_ms": 6751890,
            "end_ms": 6753970,
            "text": "本游戏为狼人混首夜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3508,
            "source_segment_index": 3508,
            "start_ms": 6753970,
            "end_ms": 6755090,
            "text": "狼人击杀一号猎人"
          },
          {
            "index": 3509,
            "source_segment_index": 3509,
            "start_ms": 6755090,
            "end_ms": 6755970,
            "text": "女巫用药救起"
          },
          {
            "index": 3510,
            "source_segment_index": 3510,
            "start_ms": 6755970,
            "end_ms": 6756670,
            "text": "形成平安夜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3511,
            "source_segment_index": 3511,
            "start_ms": 6756670,
            "end_ms": 6759070,
            "text": "当夜预言家验证8号那位好人身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 3512,
            "source_segment_index": 3512,
            "start_ms": 6759070,
            "end_ms": 6760600,
            "text": "上警环节"
          },
          {
            "index": 3513,
            "source_segment_index": 3513,
            "start_ms": 6760600,
            "end_ms": 6762700,
            "text": "12号狼人自爆入夜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3514,
            "source_segment_index": 3514,
            "start_ms": 6762700,
            "end_ms": 6765400,
            "text": "狼人击杀3号预言家女巫空过预言家验证"
          },
          {
            "index": 3515,
            "source_segment_index": 3515,
            "start_ms": 6765400,
            "end_ms": 6767010,
            "text": "11号玩家为好人身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 3516,
            "source_segment_index": 3516,
            "start_ms": 6767010,
            "end_ms": 6768750,
            "text": "第二天延期竞选警长环节"
          },
          {
            "index": 3517,
            "source_segment_index": 3517,
            "start_ms": 6768750,
            "end_ms": 6770940,
            "text": "3号预言家自动当选警长"
          },
          {
            "index": 3518,
            "source_segment_index": 3518,
            "start_ms": 6770940,
            "end_ms": 6771740,
            "text": "3号出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 3519,
            "source_segment_index": 3519,
            "start_ms": 6771740,
            "end_ms": 6773420,
            "text": "将警徽移交至11号平民"
          },
          {
            "index": 3520,
            "source_segment_index": 3520,
            "start_ms": 6773420,
            "end_ms": 6776080,
            "text": "第二天白天5号狼人被公投出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 3521,
            "source_segment_index": 3521,
            "start_ms": 6776080,
            "end_ms": 6779980,
            "text": "入夜狼击杀9号白神女巫毒杀6号狼人会"
          },
          {
            "index": 3522,
            "source_segment_index": 3522,
            "start_ms": 6779980,
            "end_ms": 6782500,
            "text": "第三天白天10号狼人被公投出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 3523,
            "source_segment_index": 3523,
            "start_ms": 6782500,
            "end_ms": 6784780,
            "text": "入夜狼人击杀2号女巫"
          },
          {
            "index": 3524,
            "source_segment_index": 3524,
            "start_ms": 6784780,
            "end_ms": 6786910,
            "text": "白天7号平民被抗推出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 3525,
            "source_segment_index": 3525,
            "start_ms": 6786910,
            "end_ms": 6788670,
            "text": "然后狼人阵营拍到最后一声"
          },
          {
            "index": 3526,
            "source_segment_index": 3526,
            "start_ms": 6788670,
            "end_ms": 6789990,
            "text": "一号猎人游戏结束"
          },
          {
            "index": 3527,
            "source_segment_index": 3527,
            "start_ms": 6789990,
            "end_ms": 6791110,
            "text": "狼人阵营屠神获胜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3528,
            "source_segment_index": 3528,
            "start_ms": 6792110,
            "end_ms": 6793850,
            "text": "感谢OKO给我的投石"
          },
          {
            "index": 3529,
            "source_segment_index": 3529,
            "start_ms": 6793850,
            "end_ms": 6794860,
            "text": "感谢好"
          },
          {
            "index": 3530,
            "source_segment_index": 3530,
            "start_ms": 6794860,
            "end_ms": 6795460,
            "text": "各位弹幕老师们"
          },
          {
            "index": 3531,
            "source_segment_index": 3531,
            "start_ms": 6795460,
            "end_ms": 6797580,
            "text": "您正在收看到的是京城大赛第21季"
          },
          {
            "index": 3532,
            "source_segment_index": 3532,
            "start_ms": 6797580,
            "end_ms": 6798160,
            "text": "鬼曲奇谭"
          },
          {
            "index": 3533,
            "source_segment_index": 3533,
            "start_ms": 6798160,
            "end_ms": 6798700,
            "text": "金城大赛"
          },
          {
            "index": 3534,
            "source_segment_index": 3534,
            "start_ms": 6798700,
            "end_ms": 6801640,
            "text": "第21季是由天天狼人app冠名赞助播出的"
          },
          {
            "index": 3535,
            "source_segment_index": 3535,
            "start_ms": 6801640,
            "end_ms": 6802440,
            "text": "各位弹幕老师们"
          },
          {
            "index": 3536,
            "source_segment_index": 3536,
            "start_ms": 6802440,
            "end_ms": 6805040,
            "text": "我们现在的时间是21.49分"
          },
          {
            "index": 3537,
            "source_segment_index": 3537,
            "start_ms": 6805040,
            "end_ms": 6806240,
            "text": "还有最后10分钟的时间"
          },
          {
            "index": 3538,
            "source_segment_index": 3538,
            "start_ms": 6806240,
            "end_ms": 6807440,
            "text": "半小时就截止了"
          },
          {
            "index": 3539,
            "source_segment_index": 3539,
            "start_ms": 6807440,
            "end_ms": 6809480,
            "text": "我们呢正在冲击八点到九点"
          },
          {
            "index": 3540,
            "source_segment_index": 3540,
            "start_ms": 6809480,
            "end_ms": 6812220,
            "text": "这个时间段里边的抖音小时的人气榜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3541,
            "source_segment_index": 3541,
            "start_ms": 6812220,
            "end_ms": 6814220,
            "text": "点开我们直播间左上角的小事榜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3542,
            "source_segment_index": 3542,
            "start_ms": 6814220,
            "end_ms": 6815900,
            "text": "或人气榜的字样之后呢"
          },
          {
            "index": 3543,
            "source_segment_index": 3543,
            "start_ms": 6815900,
            "end_ms": 6817900,
            "text": "就可以看到当前我们的实时排名了"
          },
          {
            "index": 3544,
            "source_segment_index": 3544,
            "start_ms": 6817900,
            "end_ms": 6820500,
            "text": "然后我们希望都能冲到我们今天的前十名啊"
          },
          {
            "index": 3545,
            "source_segment_index": 3545,
            "start_ms": 6820500,
            "end_ms": 6821420,
            "text": "在下方留下单"
          },
          {
            "index": 3546,
            "source_segment_index": 3546,
            "start_ms": 6821420,
            "end_ms": 6822860,
            "text": "找到人气票的选项"
          },
          {
            "index": 3547,
            "source_segment_index": 3547,
            "start_ms": 6822860,
            "end_ms": 6825620,
            "text": "一毛一张最多可以拉满200张有效的机票"
          },
          {
            "index": 3548,
            "source_segment_index": 3548,
            "start_ms": 6825620,
            "end_ms": 6826620,
            "text": "第一张非常关键"
          },
          {
            "index": 3549,
            "source_segment_index": 3549,
            "start_ms": 6826620,
            "end_ms": 6828650,
            "text": "可以帮我们增长额外200的G值"
          },
          {
            "index": 3550,
            "source_segment_index": 3550,
            "start_ms": 6828650,
            "end_ms": 6830610,
            "text": "感谢各位大宝石们帮我们一起冲榜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3551,
            "source_segment_index": 3551,
            "start_ms": 6830610,
            "end_ms": 6831090,
            "text": "谢谢大家"
          },
          {
            "index": 3552,
            "source_segment_index": 3552,
            "start_ms": 6831090,
            "end_ms": 6831690,
            "text": "另外呢"
          },
          {
            "index": 3553,
            "source_segment_index": 3553,
            "start_ms": 6831690,
            "end_ms": 6833680,
