          {
            "index": 3570,
            "source_segment_index": 3570,
            "start_ms": 6869820,
            "end_ms": 6873000,
            "text": "其实狼队一直是一个比较劣势的情况"
          },
          {
            "index": 3571,
            "source_segment_index": 3571,
            "start_ms": 6873000,
            "end_ms": 6874400,
            "text": "伴随着我们"
          },
          {
            "index": 3572,
            "source_segment_index": 3572,
            "start_ms": 6874400,
            "end_ms": 6877600,
            "text": "大卫这个金水发到预言家头上的自爆"
          },
          {
